<title>FRANCE: CNP buys 40 pct in Argentina's Provincia Vida.</title>
<headline>CNP buys 40 pct in Argentina's Provincia Vida.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer company CNP said it had signed a deal to take a 40 percent stake in Provincia Vida and a 10 percent stake in Provincia Art, both units of Banco Provincia. It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>Banco Provincia is the second-biggest bank in Argentina, CNP said in its statement. CNP has been active in the country since 1994.</p>
</text>
